---
import SlideFolio from '@components/deck/SlideFolio.astro';
---

<section class="deck-slide" id="s08-information" data-slot="information">
  <SlideFolio number={8} label="Why it compounds" />
  <div class="deck-inner">
    <h2 class="deck-title-xl max-w-[16ch] reveal-item">
      Outside of press releases, media, and <span class="gradient-text">databases</span>
    </h2>
    <hr class="deck-rule mt-10 w-28 reveal-item" style="--delay: 160ms" />
    <p class="deck-lede mt-8 max-w-[44rem] reveal-item" style="--delay: 240ms">
      Constant access to the latest market and technology development comes through deep, interpersonal relationships where information flows outside of press releases, media, and databases.
    </p>
    <p class="deck-body mt-5 text-foreground reveal-item" style="--delay: 340ms">In private markets, all that matters is being “in the deal.”</p>
  </div>
</section>
